Subject: [PATCH 4/6] fix(local): compat-shim ctx.provide, settingsNamespace
 export, pangu preset protocol

- compat-shim: set apiProxy via ctx.provide instead of direct assignment
  (cordis requires provide; 'cannot set property without provide')
- settings: add settingsNamespace(name) export (validate + return namespace;
  required by dsh-better-sidebar; matches register()/describe().ns semantics)
- agent-presets: add pangu memory protocol to autonomous preset
- apps/cli: drop dsh-agent-spine-demo / dsh-tool-subagent-report deps
- ignore .mimosa session artifacts (add .mimosaignore tool config)
